invariant: INV-16
file: poly1305_vector.h
catches: test/chacha-builds.sh
reason: poly1305_vector.h turns the vector Poly1305 on wherever the multiply is
  native, a device object on WIDEMUL=native among them, so that object
  calls a path it does not package and that nothing in its build names.
  A device object holds poly1305.c's loop alone (docs/decisions.md 89).
  The script compiles poly1305.c with -DCH_NATIVE_WIDEMUL and no host
  define and requires that its object not call poly1305_vector_blocks.

--- old
#if defined(CH_CPU_RUNTIME) && defined(CH_WIDEMUL_NATIVE)
--- new
#if defined(CH_WIDEMUL_NATIVE)
